#       the 2 survivors are GleanMetrics/Addons$RtamoFailedExtra and
#       $RtamoIdentifiedExtra, generated from metrics.yaml (LW-M4-01's file)
#       string-table needles of --check-no-adjust  : 324 -> 0
#
#   aapt2 dump xmltree --file AndroidManifest.xml   (the MERGED manifest)
#       receivers 13 -> 12, providers 13 -> 12, uses-permission 37 -> 35, and a
